<title>USA: FSA has insurance capacity for Puerto Rico issuers.</title>
<headline>FSA has insurance capacity for Puerto Rico issuers.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Security Assurance said Monday it had secondary insurance capacity for the following four Puerto Rico municipal issues.</p>
<p>--Puerto Rico Electric Power Authority. Insurance available on maturities 2007 and longer. There is no par limit per firm.</p>
<p>--Commonwealth of Puerto Rico general obligation bonds.</p>
<p>--Puerto Rico Public Building Authority.</p>
<p>--Puerto Rico Highway Authority. Insurance is available on maturities 2004 and longer. There is no par limit per firm.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
